WEBVTT

00:03:29.914 --> 00:03:32.458
with nothing more than my computer

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:35.169
and a fire hose of self-righteous anger.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:39.590
And then I started to feel
sick to my stomach.

00:03:40.216 --> 00:03:42.343
And so did JJ, at the exact same moment.

00:03:42.385 --> 00:03:46.097
We both were suddenly overcome
with this awful feeling

00:03:46.138 --> 00:03:48.349
that there was something
very bad and wrong

00:03:48.349 --> 00:03:49.558
about what we were doing,

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.936
but we could not pinpoint what it was.

00:03:51.936 --> 00:03:53.646
I just remember thinking,

00:03:53.688 --> 00:03:57.358
"Alright, I don't care about cars
getting little dings and dents,

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:58.567
but this guy does.

00:03:58.609 --> 00:04:00.111
Is that wrong somehow?